This distribution also bundles motor parameter files, under `motors/`
and `data/`,
whose numeric values are transcribed from, or estimated from, the
third-party sources below. Those values are factual measurements and
published specifications rather than third-party expression, and each
file records its own provenance and test conditions in its header
comments or accompanying README. The sources are listed here for
attribution.

## Pyleecan machine geometry

`data/prius_2004/pyleecan_geometry.json` is from the Pyleecan project
