## CREATOR open-benchmark datasets

CREATOR CRC-TRR361 (TU Graz):

  DOI 10.3217/sns1d-77m43  PMSM benchmark (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0)
  DOI 10.3217/kh3v7-dhn98  IM benchmark (CC BY-NC 4.0)

These datasets are fetched on demand and excluded from the distributed
wheel and sdist; the public release ships only the motor parameters
transcribed into `motors/creator_case_pmsm.toml` and
`data/creator_case_im/creator_case_im.toml`.

## BMW i3 supplementary files (CC BY 4.0)

`data/bmw_i3/BMWi3_GeometryAutoCAD.dxf` and
`data/bmw_i3/FEMResults_1000rpm.xlsx` are the supplementary files of
M. Gierczynski and L.M. Grzesiak, Energies 14(9):2343, 2021
(DOI 10.3390/en14092343), redistributed unmodified under
CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
`data/bmw_i3/flux_maps_7x7.json` is derived from the xlsx (angle-averaged
7×7 flux-linkage maps; see `data/bmw_i3/README.md`) and is shared under
the same license.

