## Manufacturer datasheets

Motor parameter files also draw from manufacturer datasheets and
catalogs for the following products, used as published specifications:

  ABB BSM50N series
  Beckhoff AM8051 series
  Emrax 208 / 228 axial-flux motors
  ETEL TMB torque motor series
  Kollmorgen AKM44H / B-104-B / GOLDLINE series
  Magnetic BLQ40
  Nord 80T1/4
  Rexroth MS2N series
  Tecnotion QTR direct-drive series
  WEG UE921 / UE941 (IEC frame-80)

Parameter values derived from these sources are estimates unless the
motor file marks them measured. They are not endorsed by, and imply no
affiliation with, Oak Ridge National Laboratory, UT-Battelle, the
U.S. Department of Energy, Toyota, Pyleecan/EOMYS, TU Graz, or any
manufacturer listed above.
